{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "fb5b6762cb9cf51fb69fbe9fe8831a3ccb43c251d6c8ee867bca17892036e742", "ja": "ひとりではできないこと", "zh": "一个人做不到的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ff7d2d96ea63416badc0382887617fd9f863f072c0f8f9c3b58d58ead4287e6f", "ja": "全員でシンカの原稿を手伝う中、Licht\nは周囲が離れていった過去を語る。その原因\nはLichtにもあると指摘するりこを抱き\nしめ「私に追いついて、待ってるから」と\n伝えシンカとりこを奮い立たせるのだった。", "zh": "在大家一起帮忙准备シンカ的稿件时，Licht\n讲述了身边的人逐渐离开自己的过去。りこ指出，\n造成这一切的原因Licht也有份。Licht抱住りこ，\n对她说：“追上我吧，我会等着你。”就这样让シンカ和\nりこ重新振作起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1000_narration", "source_sha256": "0fda17000c782eee8de0c76aed8f4ccd1b07129487cdb5da311af955f887757c", "ja": "全員でシンカの原稿を手伝う修羅場の最中。\nわずかな休憩時間での事……", "zh": "全员帮忙赶写シンカ的稿子，正忙得不可开交。\n这是在短暂休息时间里发生的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "381ab5df3d9c685e7d30d4e26bb9123b54be5900102a7885ccc029cae6f53086", "ja": "染みるぅ～！　エナドリしか勝たん！　なんとか\n山場は超えたけど、表紙が残ってるんだよね～……。", "zh": "太爽了～！能量饮料才是王道！总算\n熬过最难的部分了，但封面还没搞定呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "a71eee78f6a828612bb04920e738f26ee8e63e5ce4829a4876a0805e64481d23", "ja": "シンカちゃん、さっきの山場は4ページだけど、表紙は\n裏表紙入れてもたったの2枚だよ！　いけるいける♪", "zh": "シンカ，刚才的难关部分只有4页，不过封面算上封底也才2张哦！没问题没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e9736790287136a3a7058b6aa2733c402152793cd95fa8589e8ab94b332b788", "ja": "枚数だけで言えば、そうですけど！\nLicht先輩はいいな～、悩みとか無縁って感じで。", "zh": "单看页数的话，确实是这样没错，可是！Licht前辈真好啊～感觉烦恼什么的都与你无缘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "410719d229be151b0bc622187a178d878ee53af7d54443b0e756f2248e2d462b", "ja": "え、あるよ？　なんで私が神なのかなあ？って、\nいっつも不思議だし！", "zh": "诶，我也有烦恼哦？我总是在想，为什么我会被当成神明呢？一直都觉得很不可思议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "72c8dbbb39591495adb9880dd9361247f6d94d4d9f22cfb9b591c9ff5c486da6", "ja": "私は、自分がいいと思った事をやってるだけだもん。\nそれが受け入れられてるのも、運が良かっただけで。", "zh": "我只是去做自己觉得不错的事情而已。能被大家接受，也只是因为运气好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "896ea77f8d95d1df510059939fd5b577e48f98a4ab120394a17eb3df6e5db81a", "ja": "でも周りの子達は、そう思わないみたい。\nみんな、いつの間にかいなくなっちゃうしね。", "zh": "可是周围的孩子们好像不这么想。\n大家总是不知不觉就离开了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "7fb02a2c695254e59c0dfb59adba858f2d2ca4dba3a7f07aef5c02455a887cac", "ja": "Licht先輩……。", "zh": "Licht学姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "47693c239e9061a0a09a62855e609c68285edc76e25925542bbfa4c5dc574536", "ja": "だから私、このサークルがすっごく楽しいんだ。\nみんな、自分が上手くなるのに一生懸命だし♪", "zh": "所以我才觉得，这个社团特别有意思。\n大家都在努力让自己变得更厉害呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "62306e7d74f04322361466fd637efad2777752c22dcd61f7e9fbf45601beeb2b", "ja": "マンガって、ひとりじゃ連載するのも難しいでしょ？\n私もこれから先、大勢の手を借りる事があるかなって。", "zh": "漫画要一个人连载，也很难吧？  \n我想着，以后说不定也会有需要借助很多人的力量的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "17f53b414c783ef679956bd372e4514a3b8e34e1bc88eec918dd78796316801b", "ja": "だから私、人には優しくするって決めてるんだー。\nいつか私の原稿も、手伝ってもらうかもしれないしね！", "zh": "所以我决定，要对人温柔一点——\n毕竟说不定哪天，我也会请别人来帮我画稿呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "248ea12c86f49da72cdaa80a731c78c88949c722c459453d0e4650b9a1d63385", "ja": "い、いつの間にか\nアシスタント候補に入れられてる……。", "zh": "不、不知不觉就被列入助手候选名单了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "744ddf7aa47c38c25104fc6bddfa55cf315cff200389f41402eb28abaa0f5fe0", "ja": "まあ、今手伝ってもらってるし、お返しはしますよ。\nそうでなくても、Licht先輩なら手伝いますけど。", "zh": "毕竟现在也在请你帮忙，我会回报你的。\n就算不是这样，如果是Licht前辈，我也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "3ba87233b14b20899c6382756b66c90770019abc61f135d98b22873a4c64058e", "ja": "わーい！\n手伝ってよかった～♪", "zh": "太好啦！\n来帮忙真是帮对啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "e6ba266f3990d4e0cb92cf37a758929ad92dec41830e04ab6723bd05d612fc4c", "ja": "……？\nあの、Lichtさん。今のは……。", "zh": "……？\n那个，Licht小姐。刚才那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "4c699df7cf040cdfa45ef4f8c5f1ae09cb25c061506c1c95a4ecb2a002d20183", "ja": "トーコ。\n……りこちゃんに任せよう。", "zh": "Toko。  \n……交给Riko吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "bcf550a4bfd95f2e3bc049b4aa04be89ea786ec53c245872080c5bbf1ef8707a", "ja": "Lichtちゃん……今のシンカちゃんの話、\nちゃんと聞いてましたか……？", "zh": "Licht……你刚才有好好在听\n心华说的话吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "a883c953571bb17e18bc5b079a7e146af2df3dc3a5067edb72141fa7a18cdd97", "ja": "え？　今日のお返しに、\n原稿手伝ってくれるって事？", "zh": "诶？你的意思是，要帮我弄原稿，作为今天的回礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "281e44ed4b17d32587658de17951f845814b823a7ac7ef32a156a7ee4f39de68", "ja": "大事なのは、その後です！　シンカちゃんは\nそうでなくても手伝います、って言いましたよね！？", "zh": "重点在于后面的话！小心夏\n说了“就算不是这样我也会帮忙”对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "51065cad6376016b3dc2cd18ac5085fd9824827fcdfe5b4436a40e27151edcdf", "ja": "シンカちゃんはLichtちゃんの事を、仲間で、\n友達だと思ってるから、手伝うって言ってるんですよ！", "zh": "因为シンカ把Licht当作伙伴和朋友，所以才说要帮忙的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "e87dde828a6ff6f96ba68f75faabcecbcb2ef45bd5db4288e3896201b93131c4", "ja": "人の話はちゃんと聞かなくちゃダメです！　Licht\nちゃんから人が離れるのは、それも原因だと思います！", "zh": "一定要好好听别人说话才行！　我觉得大家会离开Licht，这也是其中一个原因！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb2d846ce9cecbbf0406f0cf020f43a2eaea039a7a67bde346d03568ea5df030", "ja": "自分の話をちゃんと聞いてもらえないと\n悲しくなるのは、誰だって同じです……。", "zh": "自己的话没能被别人好好听进去，会感到难过，这对谁来说都是一样的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "2b117ed08f4bda56ffe6ed2474cf7a55b6eca3e7da74b8f3f022cc4f14771cb4", "ja": "りこ！\nちょっと言い過ぎじゃ……。", "zh": "莉子！\n是不是说得有点过火了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "76162a7411c444560629d8316489acea5946d407284e40825531c5464cda56d3", "ja": "いいの。\n……りこちゃん、他にはある？", "zh": "没关系的。\n……莉子，还有别的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "2618fcaf67faeaebc79e03bd0b808e1e22bb0dacf61ec829644d417b3b53c659", "ja": "あとあと……Lichtちゃんは、ちょっとだけ、\nデリカシーが不足していると思いますっ！", "zh": "还有还有……我觉得Licht，稍微有点缺乏分寸感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "05b56d7db1c732318b6b4d5f7fd7772edcb3238da424d30ef8a7f341787f02cd", "ja": "私はLichtちゃんの事好きだし尊敬もして\nますけど、そういうところは好きじゃありませんっ！", "zh": "我喜欢Licht，也很尊敬Licht，不过那种地方我可不喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "6d82a14251df69e5c1ac0e8a2b505d59012a6c5d80606d05dfd965e8b50a578c", "ja": "……うんっ！　ありがとう！\nりこちゃん、大好きーーー！！！", "zh": "……嗯！谢谢你！\n莉子，我最喜欢你啦———！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "18708f9638e0ed0de35ae8e2d89c20b467cc86c09085d02bbeb24eb9f9643d35", "ja": "すっ！？\nな、なんでそうなるんですかー！！？", "zh": "诶！？怎么会变成这样啊——！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "e4670aac41379ba06b4f4374ca02e27fe24661a252795c9bb4b1a1d8eac8a890", "ja": "ふふっ。……やっぱり、\nここは温かくて、いいサークルね。", "zh": "呵呵……果然，\n这里很温暖，是个很棒的社团呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "103819a410f8444983f9a808ce68938611251c4450473d2eca81db3e5da904fa", "ja": "でしょ？　……みんな、そろそろ休憩はおしまい！\nラストスパート、集中して取り掛かるよ！", "zh": "对吧？……大家，休息差不多该结束了！\n最后冲刺，集中精神开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "09cc4f9d956878c222da8bfe14793f46f804dc6fbfaaf7ea6d763bec4da138e2", "ja": "はーい！\n……ねえ、シンカちゃん、りこちゃん。", "zh": "好——！\n……那个，星歌，小莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "5363c612b2e82281843d5d30e79ec223223d37064760b8b4f55aeaaefa355604", "ja": "私が追いかけようとしていた相手は、降りちゃったの。\n……でも、私は降りないから。約束する。", "zh": "我一直想追赶的那个人，已经退出了。\n……但我不会退出的。我保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_08_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "98eed44cf90d8d1318b58c13fe8641c4425383bdf7e1e0b1e2b8aaa243aafd6c", "ja": "私、待ってるから。\nふたりは、私に追いつけるように、頑張ってね！", "zh": "我会在这里等着的。\n你们两个，要努力追上我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
